  U+16ED|᛭|RUNIC CROSS PUNCTUATION|cross
# Latin -> runes rules, matched greedily longest-first after NFC + lower-casing.
# A set uses its own rules first, then its parent's. Unmatched accented letters fall back
# to their base letter; anything still unmatched (digits, punctuation) passes through.
# convention=true marks a modern choice for a letter the set has no rune for.
